Output nmk.mp4
Output nmk.gif
Set FontSize 28
Set Width 1400
Set Height 900
Set Padding 40
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "# the HomePlug key derivation is public. the default password is too."
Sleep 800ms Enter
Type "cat nmk.py | head -13" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Type "python3 nmk.py" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "# same NMK as every factory-default modem. no hardware involved." Sleep 800ms Enter
Sleep 3s
